  <h2>Privacy Policy – AI Messaging Assistant</h2>

  <p>
    We (“we”, “our”, or “us”) respect your privacy. This policy explains how customer communication data is handled when using our AI-powered WhatsApp customer support and enquiry handling services.
  </p>

  <h3>1. Data We Collect</h3>

  <p>We may collect and process the following information submitted voluntarily through WhatsApp:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Phone number</li>
    <li>Messages submitted through WhatsApp</li>
    <li>Appointment or enquiry information voluntarily provided by users</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Data Usage</h3>

  <p>Your data is used solely for:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Customer support</li>
    <li>Service improvement</li>
    <li>Enquiry handling</li>
    <li>Appointment coordination</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We do not sell personal data to third parties.</p>

  <h3>3. Security</h3>

  <p>
    We take reasonable steps to protect customer communication data and maintain appropriate safeguards to prevent unauthorised access, misuse, or disclosure.
  </p>

  <h3>4. Data Deletion Requests</h3>

  <p>
    Users may request deletion of their data at any time by contacting:
    <a href="mailto:info@ctron.co.uk">info@ctron.co.uk</a>
  </p>

  <h3>5. Contact</h3>

